  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cold "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soba",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "soba"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " noodles are cooked, rinsed in ice-cold water, and served with a chilled "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tsuyu",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tsuyu"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " dipping sauce on the side. You dip bundles of noodles into the sauce before eating, adding "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "wasabi",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "wasabi"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and spring onion to taste. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rinsing the cooked noodles under cold running water and then under iced water stops cooking instantly and firms the texture. Do not skip this step."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
